      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "SNEAKO learns about the time Adolf Hitler gifted the Crown Prince of Malaysia's grandfather a brand new Mercedes\u2026\ud83d\ude99\ud83d\udd25\n\n\"We have 2 cars that were presented by Hitler to Sultan Ibrahim, who is my late late grandfather. Mercedes actually offered us \u20ac4Million to buy them from us\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/SNEAKOHQ/status/2047844074078785604",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T01:04:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Clavicular Calls SNEAKO after Chat keeps asking about their \u201cBeef\u201d...\ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude2c\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/SNEAKOHQ/status/2047784738648477717",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T21:08:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In one week I brought the Prime Minister and the Prince of Malaysia on stream \n\nThank you for hosting me \nPhilippines next- my motherland",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/sneako/status/2047802596912746944",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T22:19:20+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Alhamdulilah for everything \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffd",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/sneako/status/2047764151943184573",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T19:46:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "SNEAKO was given exclusive access to play football at the Sultan Ibrahim Stadium in Malaysia\u26bd\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfe\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/SNEAKOHQ/status/2047597502120255710",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T08:44:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you for your contributions to the love speech charity. Because of your efforts we fed children and families of Gaza this past lent / ramadan. Lebanon charity next!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/sneako/status/2047556096559288522",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-24T05:59:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Back in Malaysia- big stream tomorrow around 2pm this timezone. Can\u2019t announce it yet but because I can\u2019t announce it you should know it\u2019s good. \n\nThen Philippines after- my homeland. Looking for tour guides and collabs \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/AltSNEAKO/status/2047328199789691142",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T14:54:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "sneako",
      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In America I get parking tickets from a camera but the man who pepper sprayed me 4k in my home city has still not been arrested.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/sneako/status/2047345563243520026",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-23T16:03:14+00:00",
